cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use WSPBench, cite this software and record the source commit,
  dataset revision and access condition used in your experiment.
type: software
title: "WSPBench: controlled weight-space programming evaluation"
authors:
  - name: WSPBench contributors
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  WSPBench compares diagnosis and selective repair with and without access to
  neural network weights. It grades repairs on hidden examples for both fault
  correction and preservation of previously correct behavior.
keywords:
  - weight-space programming
  - language-model evaluation
  - interpretability
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
